#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.rumo.gschema.xml:6
msgid "Enable XWayland clipboard paste fallback"
msgstr "启用 XWayland 剪贴板粘贴回退"

#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.rumo.gschema.xml:7
msgid ""
"When the focused window has no Wayland text-input context and non-ASCII text "
"is committed, temporarily paste via clipboard and restore previous clipboard "
"contents."
msgstr ""
"当焦点窗口没有 Wayland 文本输入上下文且提交非 ASCII 文本时，通过剪贴板临时"
"粘贴并恢复原有剪贴板内容。"

#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.rumo.gschema.xml:11
msgid "Keyboard height ratio relative to monitor height"
msgstr "键盘高度占显示器高度的比例"

#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.rumo.gschema.xml:12
msgid ""
"Height of the on-screen keyboard as a fraction of the active monitor height."
msgstr "屏幕键盘高度占当前显示器高度的比例。"

#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.rumo.gschema.xml:16
msgid "Show top bar toggle indicator"
msgstr "显示顶栏切换指示器"

#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.rumo.gschema.xml:17
msgid "Show a keyboard toggle button in the GNOME Shell top bar."
msgstr "在 GNOME Shell 顶栏中显示虚拟键盘切换按钮。"

#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.rumo.gschema.xml:21
msgid "Recently used symbols"
msgstr "最近使用的符号"

#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.rumo.gschema.xml:22
msgid ""
"Ordered list of recently used symbols in the symbol picker (most recent "
"first)."
msgstr "符号面板中最近使用符号的有序列表（最近使用的排在前面）。"

#: src/platform/oskManager.ts:165
msgid "Rumo Keyboard"
msgstr "如梦虚拟键盘"

#: src/ui/candidateDrawer.ts:182
msgid "Loading more…"
msgstr "正在加载更多…"

#: src/ui/candidateDrawer.ts:182
msgid "Load more candidates"
msgstr "加载更多候选词"

#: src/ui/keyButton.ts:98
msgid "Space"
msgstr "空格"

#: src/ui/symbolPickerView.ts:253
msgid "No recently used symbols"
msgstr "暂无最近使用的符号"
